(7718788, 1269512, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Where is this, Wendy?  What a capture!  Great choice for top honors! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Sandy! Its in downtown Richmond, VA. If you keep going under this bridge, its on the other side of the river.<br/> <br/><a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/L8xLXQmv78hkVwoi8" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Downtown</a></td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Where is this, Wendy?  What a capture!  Great choice for top honors!   Thanks Sandy! Its in downtown Richmond, VA. If you keep going under this bridge, its on the other side of the river. Downtown', '2022-04-16 21:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
