(7723219, 1269407, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the approach you took with this image.  The comment you made in the "Photographer''s Comments" is so true!  :-)<br/> <br/>One thing that could have made this a little stronger, IMO, would have been to try and reduce the glare on the headlight housing.  Either a polarizing filter (at the time of image capture), or possibly the use of ''clarify'' in post would have worked.</td>', 'I like the approach you took with this image.  The comment you made in the "Photographer''s Comments" is so true!  :-) One thing that could have made this a little stronger, IMO, would have been to try and reduce the glare on the headlight housing.  Either a polarizing filter (at the time of image capture), or possibly the use of ''clarify'' in post would have worked.', '2022-07-10 19:27:39.000000', NULL, 0);
